(defbehavior smoke-s98 process ()
  "Scenario 98 (`smoke-scenario-late`), trailer v2: the Freedom League's drops again with the camera
   closer (20 m off, 4 m up, its look leaning to the unit), then three blue guard point-of-view takes
   in the open North Farms where every unit is sent (scenario 96's first and third missed the
   fight). No check of its own."
  (smoke-trl-v2-start BF_TEAM_FF 0 "deploy blue guard")
